    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Dwarf (wildhamnmer), orc, tauren, or troll</em></p><p>You have seen the balance and harmony the spirits bring. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Increase your Wisdom or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>You have advantage on saving throws against being frightened.</p></li><li><p>You learn the healing spirit spell, and can cast it once with this feat, without expending a spell slot. You regain the ability to cast it in this way when you finish a long rest. Wisdom is your spellcasting ability for this spell.</p></li></ul>",
